cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this research package, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Exact degree and real-point counts in a localized sector of quantum Levi–Civita connections on (ℤ₂)⁴: A computer-assisted classification of a marked path–triangle sector"
authors:
  - family-names: Torsheim
    given-names: Marius
version: "0.13"
date-released: 2026-10-30
abstract: >-
  Manuscript revision 0.13 and exact computational supplement revision 2.3
  for a marked, spatially homogeneous, trace-zero localized path–triangle
  sector of quantum Levi–Civita connections. The declared sector has generic
  complex degree 512 and, at the stated rational metric, 512 reduced complex
  points, including 204 real points.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Torsheim/quantum-gravity-qlc"
